{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite", "body": [{"content": "如果你是2026年的竞技射击游戏玩家", "from": 3.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 1, "to": 6.58}, {"content": "现在正是开始瞄准训练的最佳时机", "from": 6.58, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 2, "to": 10.27}, {"content": "随着像Voltaic这样的瞄准小组发展壮大", "from": 10.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 3, "to": 12.55}, {"content": "以及现在Raw Input", "from": 12.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 4, "to": 13.75}, {"content": "这里汇聚了技艺精湛的选手，不断产出新的训练内容和资源", "from": 13.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 5, "to": 19.46}, {"content": "这里有大量信息将指引你的训练之路", "from": 19.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 6, "to": 22.7}, {"content": "助你成为可能的顶尖射手", "from": 22.7, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 7, "to": 25.43}, {"content": "而借助Aim Labs", "from": 25.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 8, "to": 26.35}, {"content": "Esports Now", "from": 26.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 9, "to": 27.09}, {"content": "就在眼前，各类型射击游戏的职业选手", "from": 27.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 10, "to": 31.17}, {"content": "都在不断提升自己的操作水平", "from": 31.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 11, "to": 33.01}, {"content": "今天开始瞄准训练能收获颇丰", "from": 33.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 12, "to": 36.05}, {"content": "如果你正在观看这个视频", "from": 36.05, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 13, "to": 37.33}, {"content": "并认为自己开始得太晚了", "from": 37.33, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 14, "to": 39.97}, {"content": "哦", "from": 39.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 15, "to": 40.39}, {"content": "我X岁了", "from": 40.39, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 16, "to": 41.57}, {"content": "根本不可能", "from": 41.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 17, "to": 42.13}, {"content": "追上那些", "from": 42.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 18, "to": 43.95}, {"content": "磨练了近几十年的年轻一代玩家", "from": 43.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 19, "to": 47.64}, {"content": "不必担心", "from": 47.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 20, "to": 48.82}, {"content": "这里有一个五岁的小射手", "from": 48.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 21, "to": 51.74}, {"content": "已在Aim Labs达到令人印象深刻的水平", "from": 51.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 22, "to": 54.96}, {"content": "官方基准测试", "from": 54.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 23, "to": 55.97}, {"content": "如果你手部功能正常且真心致力于提升瞄准", "from": 55.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 24, "to": 59.97}, {"content": "在这个视频中不存在太晚开始的说法", "from": 59.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 25, "to": 63.59}, {"content": "我将一步步指导你如何开始瞄准训练", "from": 63.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 26, "to": 66.23}, {"content": "分步进行", "from": 66.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 27, "to": 67.31}, {"content": "这是三集迷你系列的第一集", "from": 67.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 28, "to": 69.85}, {"content": "我将从引导你完成初始步骤开始", "from": 69.85, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 29, "to": 72.63}, {"content": "比如选择哪种瞄准训练器", "from": 72.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 30, "to": 74.72}, {"content": "设置训练器并挑选合适的场景开始练习", "from": 74.72, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 31, "to": 78.31}, {"content": "然后我会更新我的五大训练技巧视频", "from": 78.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 32, "to": 83.06}, {"content": "这是2021年发布的旧视频", "from": 83.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 33, "to": 86.48}, {"content": "曾非常受欢迎", "from": 86.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 34, "to": 87.87}, {"content": "这些技巧如今有些过时或信息不足", "from": 87.87, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 35, "to": 91.45}, {"content": "这将是系列的一部分", "from": 91.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 36, "to": 93.27}, {"content": "最后将解析人们认为瞄准训练无效的常见原因", "from": 93.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 37, "to": 98.38}, {"content": "并解释这些理由大多站不住脚或目光短浅", "from": 98.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 38, "to": 103.02}, {"content": "我将从本视频开始", "from": 103.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 39, "to": 104.42}, {"content": "后续内容将陆续推出", "from": 104.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 40, "to": 107.14}, {"content": "Steam上有三个主要瞄准训练器", "from": 107.7, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 41, "to": 110.84}, {"content": "它们是Kovacs", "from": 110.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 42, "to": 112.06}, {"content": "FPS Aim Trainer", "from": 112.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 43, "to": 113.12}, {"content": "Aim Labs和Aim Beast", "from": 113.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 44, "to": 114.78}, {"content": "作为新手该选择哪个", "from": 114.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 45, "to": 117.46}, {"content": "为何我认为对于完全的新手", "from": 117.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 46, "to": 122.0}, {"content": "尤其是刚接触鼠标键盘游戏", "from": 122.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 47, "to": 125.1}, {"content": "建议从Aim Labs开始", "from": 125.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 48, "to": 128.279}, {"content": "在Aim Labs发现优质场景不再困难", "from": 128.279, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 49, "to": 132.019}, {"content": "主流瞄准小组Voltaic已与Aim Labs长期合作", "from": 132.019, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 50, "to": 136.18}, {"content": "因此，他们最新的资源和训练流程都可以在那里获取", "from": 136.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 51, "to": 140.38}, {"content": "而且完全免费", "from": 140.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 52, "to": 143.54}, {"content": "然而", "from": 144.34, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 53, "to": 144.88}, {"content": "就我最诚实的看法", "from": 144.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 54, "to": 146.62}, {"content": "你绝对不会出错", "from": 146.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 55, "to": 148.58}, {"content": "从kovacs开始训练", "from": 148.58, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 56, "to": 149.86}, {"content": "在Steam上只需十美元的超低价就能获得FPS训练器", "from": 149.86, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 57, "to": 154.51}, {"content": "你可以获得最丰富的场景和游戏列表选择", "from": 154.51, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 58, "to": 158.81}, {"content": "以及极其简洁的用户界面和导航", "from": 158.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 59, "to": 162.579}, {"content": "但最重要的是", "from": 162.739, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 60, "to": 163.859}, {"content": "你将体验到更完善的训练场景", "from": 163.859, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 61, "to": 166.259}, {"content": "因为它们具有抛物线运动轨迹", "from": 166.259, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 62, "to": 168.579}, {"content": "不必深入数学原理", "from": 168.579, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 63, "to": 169.859}, {"content": "但当你在Aim Labs提升等级和移动技能时", "from": 169.859, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 64, "to": 173.01}, {"content": "你可能会发现目标移动有时过于直线化", "from": 173.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 65, "to": 176.79}, {"content": "或感觉像是被直接编程进kovacs的场景", "from": 176.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 66, "to": 180.5}, {"content": "场景移动更随机且更贴近真实FPS游戏体验", "from": 180.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 67, "to": 185.78}, {"content": "接下来是另一个选择", "from": 185.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 68, "to": 187.48}, {"content": "这是三个中最不受欢迎的", "from": 187.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 69, "to": 189.54}, {"content": "同时场景种类也最少", "from": 189.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 70, "to": 192.03}, {"content": "Aim Beast同样是付费训练器，Steam售价仅八美元", "from": 192.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 71, "to": 196.67}, {"content": "比kovacs更便宜", "from": 196.67, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 72, "to": 197.91}, {"content": "但提供的内容稍少", "from": 197.91, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 73, "to": 200.72}, {"content": "然而", "from": 200.72, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 74, "to": 201.24}, {"content": "在我看来，Aim Beast在三项中表现最佳", "from": 201.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 75, "to": 204.74}, {"content": "并提供本视频中任何训练器中最具挑战性的场景", "from": 204.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 76, "to": 209.96}, {"content": "我将为你提供全面的入门训练计划", "from": 209.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 77, "to": 212.98}, {"content": "我只会使用Aim Labs和kovacs来构建这个计划", "from": 212.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 78, "to": 216.76}, {"content": "我对Aim Beast的场景经验较少", "from": 216.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 79, "to": 219.8}, {"content": "我认为对于新手来说这不是最佳选择", "from": 219.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 80, "to": 222.1}, {"content": "如果你刚开始学习", "from": 222.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 81, "to": 223.54}, {"content": "然而", "from": 223.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 82, "to": 223.98}, {"content": "如果你发现享受训练并想探索更多资源", "from": 223.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 83, "to": 228.3}, {"content": "或挑战更高难度", "from": 228.3, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 84, "to": 229.66}, {"content": "强烈建议你购买Aim Beast亲自尝试", "from": 229.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 85, "to": 232.959}, {"content": "在积累一些经验后", "from": 232.959, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 86, "to": 235.879}, {"content": "让我们进入简要设置指南", "from": 235.879, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 87, "to": 238.119}, {"content": "好的", "from": 238.119, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 88, "to": 239.42}, {"content": "我们首先从Aim Lab设置指南开始", "from": 239.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 89, "to": 242.78}, {"content": "这不是每个设置的详细教程", "from": 242.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 90, "to": 247.18}, {"content": "这只是默认设置的概览", "from": 247.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 91, "to": 251.92}, {"content": "我认为所有人都应该使用这些设置", "from": 251.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 92, "to": 253.54}, {"content": "如果你玩Aim Labs或训练器", "from": 253.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 93, "to": 256.92}, {"content": "我们将从游戏配置文件的灵敏度标签开始", "from": 256.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 94, "to": 261.95}, {"content": "我们选择《守望先锋》", "from": 261.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 95, "to": 263.61}, {"content": "因为我们将使用到的设置", "from": 263.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 96, "to": 266.87}, {"content": "比如视野范围", "from": 266.87, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 97, "to": 267.97}, {"content": "103度视野是当前几乎所有场景设计的基础", "from": 267.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 98, "to": 272.19}, {"content": "因此建议保持这个标准", "from": 272.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 99, "to": 275.13}, {"content": "所以请遵循这个设置", "from": 275.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 100, "to": 277.38}, {"content": "你可以设置更高的视场角", "from": 277.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 101, "to": 279.26}, {"content": "但我不建议你调得太低", "from": 279.26, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 102, "to": 281.02}, {"content": "除非是特定情况或特定训练需求", "from": 281.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 103, "to": 285.24}, {"content": "其他内容你可以直接复制到这里", "from": 285.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 104, "to": 287.56}, {"content": "高级设置中的灵敏度选项你需要保留", "from": 288.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 105, "to": 291.799}, {"content": "这样当你进入鼠标设置界面时", "from": 291.799, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 106, "to": 295.919}, {"content": "在灵敏度下方", "from": 295.919, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 107, "to": 297.099}, {"content": "你可以设置360度距离", "from": 297.099, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 108, "to": 299.56}, {"content": "我确定这就是工作原理", "from": 299.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 109, "to": 302.98}, {"content": "你需要先点击高级选项", "from": 302.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 110, "to": 305.2}, {"content": "这样才能在360度模式下调整灵敏度", "from": 305.2, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 111, "to": 308.86}, {"content": "CM 360是瞄准训练中的通用灵敏度单位", "from": 309.3, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 112, "to": 314.0}, {"content": "或者几乎所有射击类游戏和瞄准场景", "from": 314.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 113, "to": 319.34}, {"content": "如果你还不清楚自己的灵敏度", "from": 319.34, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 114, "to": 322.06}, {"content": "可能正在使用过时的EDPI测量值", "from": 322.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 115, "to": 326.64}, {"content": "你需要前往鼠标设置灵敏度", "from": 326.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 116, "to": 329.34}, {"content": "通过CM 360进行单位转换", "from": 329.34, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 117, "to": 332.94}, {"content": "然后导入到Aim Labs", "from": 332.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 118, "to": 335.28}, {"content": "这是最简便的操作方式", "from": 335.28, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 119, "to": 337.18}, {"content": "可以选择特定游戏配置文件灵敏度", "from": 337.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 120, "to": 340.91}, {"content": "但我不建议这样做", "from": 340.91, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 121, "to": 342.61}, {"content": "直接采用通用的360度设置", "from": 342.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 122, "to": 346.15}, {"content": "其他内容可以直接复制过来", "from": 346.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 123, "to": 350.0}, {"content": "至于手柄", "from": 350.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 124, "to": 354.03}, {"content": "我们不需要你使用手柄", "from": 354.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 125, "to": 358.13}, {"content": "对于准星设置", "from": 358.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 126, "to": 359.47}, {"content": "几乎可以使用任何你喜欢的准星", "from": 359.47, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 127, "to": 361.17}, {"content": "根据个人偏好选择", "from": 361.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 128, "to": 362.299}, {"content": "可以直接将准星导入游戏中", "from": 362.299, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 129, "to": 364.619}, {"content": "无需使用描述中的准星生成器", "from": 364.619, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 130, "to": 367.539}, {"content": "我已提供三个必备准星", "from": 367.539, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 131, "to": 370.56}, {"content": "你可以自行寻找更多", "from": 370.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 132, "to": 372.52}, {"content": "但我认为这三个就足够了", "from": 372.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 133, "to": 376.34}, {"content": "第一个是Z+1", "from": 376.58, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 134, "to": 377.88}, {"content": "这是几乎所有瞄准者默认使用的准星", "from": 377.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 135, "to": 381.44}, {"content": "外观就是这样", "from": 381.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 136, "to": 383.46}, {"content": "通常用于点击和目标切换", "from": 384.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 137, "to": 387.0}, {"content": "另一个我们之前见过的雪地锐点", "from": 387.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 138, "to": 390.57}, {"content": "这是一个更小的加号准星，适合追踪场景", "from": 390.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 139, "to": 395.23}, {"content": "还有一个是雪地柔边准星", "from": 395.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 140, "to": 399.13}, {"content": "如果你不喜欢轮廓线", "from": 399.519, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 141, "to": 402.099}, {"content": "这个更适合点击场景", "from": 402.099, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 142, "to": 405.93}, {"content": "继续下一个", "from": 406.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 143, "to": 407.57}, {"content": "我们进入目标设置", "from": 407.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 144, "to": 409.9}, {"content": "这些参数可以随意调整", "from": 409.9, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 145, "to": 412.28}, {"content": "主要受主题影响", "from": 412.28, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 146, "to": 414.16}, {"content": "呃", "from": 414.16, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 147, "to": 414.84}, {"content": "你使用的音频主题", "from": 414.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 148, "to": 417.78}, {"content": "我喜欢只开启命中音和击杀音", "from": 418.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 149, "to": 423.039}, {"content": "有时也会使用Pay Base音效", "from": 423.439, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 150, "to": 425.799}, {"content": "我的意思是，这基本上听起来像什么", "from": 425.799, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 151, "to": 427.759}, {"content": "当你不断命中目标或击杀目标时", "from": 427.759, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 152, "to": 430.73}, {"content": "命中音效的音调会持续升高", "from": 430.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 153, "to": 434.41}, {"content": "我不太喜欢运行生成声音和实验室的图形", "from": 434.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 154, "to": 439.74}, {"content": "我觉得你们应该直接复制这里几乎所有内容", "from": 439.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 155, "to": 442.34}, {"content": "我现在处于全屏模式", "from": 442.34, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 156, "to": 443.96}, {"content": "只是为了更好地帮助我录制", "from": 443.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 157, "to": 446.419}, {"content": "但你应该在此运行全屏独占模式", "from": 446.419, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 158, "to": 449.059}, {"content": "如果你有卡顿", "from": 449.059, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 159, "to": 450.81}, {"content": "你应该运行全屏窗口模式", "from": 450.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 160, "to": 453.33}, {"content": "因为某些场景会出现卡顿", "from": 454.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 161, "to": 455.69}, {"content": "如果它们没有", "from": 455.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 162, "to": 456.53}, {"content": "呃", "from": 456.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 163, "to": 457.17}, {"content": "如果它们处于全屏", "from": 457.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 164, "to": 458.89}, {"content": "其他一切应该都能对齐", "from": 459.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 165, "to": 461.27}, {"content": "所有这些图形设置", "from": 461.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 166, "to": 463.03}, {"content": "你都要调到最快", "from": 463.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 167, "to": 464.59}, {"content": "关闭", "from": 464.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 168, "to": 465.05}, {"content": "每一个", "from": 465.05, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 169, "to": 465.79}, {"content": "这些选项中的任何一个", "from": 465.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 170, "to": 466.83}, {"content": "你不希望有视觉杂乱", "from": 466.83, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 171, "to": 468.75}, {"content": "或游戏中发生的任何特效", "from": 468.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 172, "to": 471.09}, {"content": "尤其是在名称训练器中，所有这些都应显示在视觉标签里", "from": 471.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 173, "to": 476.51}, {"content": "这里不需要担心太多", "from": 477.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 174, "to": 479.77}, {"content": "通常这会是一个非常奇怪的解释，试图调整光照正确", "from": 479.77, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 175, "to": 483.63}, {"content": "但他们已经大幅更新了UI", "from": 483.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 176, "to": 486.26}, {"content": "你只需加载视频描述中包含的主题", "from": 486.26, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 177, "to": 490.66}, {"content": "使用此标签中的加载主题选项", "from": 490.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 178, "to": 494.42}, {"content": "这里的所有其他内容都会被自动覆盖", "from": 495.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 179, "to": 498.82}, {"content": "在游戏内", "from": 500.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 180, "to": 501.71}, {"content": "你可以再次复制这里的所有内容", "from": 502.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 181, "to": 504.21}, {"content": "确保关闭你的武器", "from": 504.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 182, "to": 506.61}, {"content": "我知道有些人会争论说", "from": 506.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 183, "to": 510.52}, {"content": "如果他们是新手，想要最佳游戏翻译", "from": 510.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 184, "to": 514.71}, {"content": "应该保留武器模型", "from": 514.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 185, "to": 516.05}, {"content": "但我不觉得这对你有帮助", "from": 516.05, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 186, "to": 518.95}, {"content": "除了遮挡你的视野", "from": 518.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 187, "to": 520.99}, {"content": "其他一切", "from": 521.28, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 188, "to": 522.62}, {"content": "应该都一样", "from": 522.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 189, "to": 524.63}, {"content": "这就是简单的Aim Labs设置指南", "from": 524.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 190, "to": 528.09}, {"content": "现在我们将继续介绍Kovacs的设置", "from": 528.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 191, "to": 532.86}, {"content": "我强烈建议你查看我最新的Kovacs设置指南", "from": 532.86, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 192, "to": 536.68}, {"content": "FPS同款训练器，链接在描述中", "from": 536.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 193, "to": 540.11}, {"content": "我不会在视频中逐项设置Kovacs", "from": 540.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 194, "to": 543.37}, {"content": "我会", "from": 543.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 195, "to": 544.07}, {"content": "不过请前往视觉标签", "from": 544.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 196, "to": 546.569}, {"content": "描述中也包含相关内容", "from": 546.569, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 197, "to": 548.189}, {"content": "这是你初始阶段仅需的两个主题", "from": 548.189, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 198, "to": 552.209}, {"content": "Kovacs", "from": 552.209, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 199, "to": 552.91}, {"content": "Clover静态用于静止状态", "from": 552.91, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 200, "to": 554.65}, {"content": "目标场景与三叶草交替", "from": 554.65, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 201, "to": 556.99}, {"content": "这是为实际用途制作的最佳主题", "from": 556.99, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 202, "to": 559.79}, {"content": "在所有训练器中添加命中音效的其他需求", "from": 559.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 203, "to": 563.43}, {"content": "导入时我已包含三个音效文件", "from": 563.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 204, "to": 566.27}, {"content": "你需要根据命名方式设置音效", "from": 566.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 205, "to": 569.0}, {"content": "所以", "from": 569.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 206, "to": 569.44}, {"content": "例如", "from": 569.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 207, "to": 569.96}, {"content": "将使用名为hit sound ogg的音效", "from": 569.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 208, "to": 573.02}, {"content": "作为游戏击中目标时播放的音效", "from": 573.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 209, "to": 575.69}, {"content": "这些音效组合使用时的声音效果", "from": 575.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 210, "to": 579.45}, {"content": "其他音效如失误音或射击音需关闭", "from": 591.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 211, "to": 595.66}, {"content": "如之前所示", "from": 595.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 212, "to": 597.1}, {"content": "务必确保关闭所有枪械显示", "from": 597.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 213, "to": 600.78}, {"content": "弹孔或默认开启的任何随机外观反馈", "from": 600.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 214, "to": 605.16}, {"content": "确保获得尽可能简洁的体验", "from": 605.16, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 215, "to": 609.94}, {"content": "我认为训练器应默认关闭所有多余功能", "from": 609.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 216, "to": 614.14}, {"content": "但现在我们必须处理这些", "from": 614.14, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 217, "to": 617.51}, {"content": "关于流程和预期玩法", "from": 617.51, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 218, "to": 620.26}, {"content": "我将为两个训练器制作版本", "from": 620.26, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 219, "to": 623.2}, {"content": "但我们将使用kovacs进行演示", "from": 623.2, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 220, "to": 625.49}, {"content": "别担心", "from": 625.49, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 221, "to": 626.17}, {"content": "所有训练器训练内容完全相同", "from": 626.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 222, "to": 629.839}, {"content": "每个流程包含十五个场景分三类", "from": 629.839, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 223, "to": 634.47}, {"content": "因此包含五个点击场景", "from": 634.47, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 224, "to": 636.55}, {"content": "五个追踪场景和五个切换场景", "from": 636.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 225, "to": 639.49}, {"content": "重要的是五个场景的顺序需注意", "from": 639.49, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 226, "to": 644.599}, {"content": "这是你应该优先的顺序", "from": 644.599, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 227, "to": 647.75}, {"content": "不仅仅是播放顺序", "from": 647.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 228, "to": 649.27}, {"content": "必须先掌握点击场景一", "from": 649.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 229, "to": 651.43}, {"content": "然后点击场景二依此类推", "from": 651.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.055045869034544365, "sid": 230, "to": 654.13}, {"content": "因为场景相互关联", "from": 654.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.05084745547256708, "sid": 231, "to": 656.98}, {"content": "你无需先掌握点击再学追踪或反之", "from": 656.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 232, "to": 661.52}, {"content": "但需按类别顺序进行", "from": 661.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 233, "to": 664.42}, {"content": "这也是播放列表以两个基础静态点击场景开头的原因", "from": 664.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 234, "to": 670.0}, {"content": "在这些场景中", "from": 670.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 235, "to": 671.08}, {"content": "目的是迫使你学习巴多方法", "from": 671.08, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 236, "to": 673.76}, {"content": "这是任何侧重点击场景的基础点击时机方法", "from": 673.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 237, "to": 676.6}, {"content": "包含初始点击和微调动作", "from": 676.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 238, "to": 679.349}, {"content": "描述中有几段视频解释巴多方法", "from": 679.349, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 239, "to